+         EC_GFp_nistp256_method()
+         EC_GFp_nistp521_method()
+
+     EC_GROUP_new_by_curve_name() will automatically use these (while
+     EC_GROUP_new_curve_GFp() currently prefers the more flexible
+     implementations).
