+     http://theory.stanford.edu/~dabo/papers/faults.ps.gz).
+     [Ulf Moeller]
+  
+  *) MIPS assembler BIGNUM division bug fix. 
+     [Andy Polyakov]
+
+  *) Disabled incorrect Alpha assembler code.
+     [Richard Levitte]
+
