+
+  *) Fix for Irix with NO_ASM.
+     ["Bruce W. Forsberg" <bruce.forsberg@baesystems.com>]
+
+  *) ./config script fixes.
+     [Ulf Moeller, Richard Levitte]
+
+  *) Fix 'openssl passwd -1'.
+     [Bodo Moeller]
