+  *) Fix a deadlock in CRYPTO_mem_leaks().
+     [Bodo Moeller]
+
+  *) Use better test patterns in bntest.
+     [Ulf Möller]
+
+  *) rand_win.c fix for Borland C.
+     [Ulf Möller]
