+     [Steve Henson]
+
+  *) New 'passwd' tool for crypt(3) and apr1 password hashes.
+     [Bodo Moeller]
+
+  *) Add command line password options to the remaining applications.
+     [Steve Henson]
+
+  *) Bug fix for BN_div_recp() for numerators with an even number of
