+     [Ulf Möller]
+
+  *) More tests in bntest.c, and changed test_bn output.
+     [Ulf Möller]
+
+  *) ./config recognizes MacOS X now.
+     [Andy Polyakov]
+
+  *) Bug fix for BN_div() when the first words of num and divsor are
