+    /*-
+     * We have many cases were we want to do
+     *   in[x] * in[y] +
+     *   in[y] * in[x]
+     * This is obviously just
+     *   2 * in[x] * in[y]
+     * However, rather than do the doubling on the 128 bit result, we
+     * double one of the inputs to the multiplication by reading from
+     * |inx2|
