+# This module implements Poly1305 hash for ARMv8.
+#
+# June 2015
+#
+# Numbers are cycles per processed byte with poly1305_blocks alone.
+#
+#		IALU/gcc-4.9	NEON
+#
+# Apple A7	1.86/+5%	0.72
+# Cortex-A53	2.69/+58%	1.47
+# Cortex-A57	2.70/+7%	1.14
+# Denver	1.64/+50%	1.18(*)
+# X-Gene	2.13/+68%	2.27
+# Mongoose	1.77/+75%	1.12
