+X509_get_signature_nid(), X509_REQ_get_signature_nid() and
+X509_CRL_get_signature_nid() return a NID.
+
+X509_get0_signature(), X509_REQ_get0_signature() and
+X509_CRL_get0_signature() do not return values.
